4: The assignment must be written `??=` instead of repeating its target.
	risky TypeUnknown: the property may be readonly, hooked or magic, and `??=` may skip its write
5: The assignment must be written `.=` instead of repeating its target.
	risky BehaviorChanges: the right side may change the property before `.=` reads it
6: The assignment must be written `+=` instead of repeating its target.
	risky BehaviorChanges: the right side may change the property before `+=` reads it
